BTW EXTRA CREDIT: BUKKIT slots can be read, updated, and used in expressions
HAI
  WAZZUP
    I HAS A scores ITZ A BUKKIT
    scores HAS A quiz ITZ 7
    scores HAS A project ITZ 9
  BUHBYE

  VISIBLE "quiz=" + scores'Z quiz
  scores'Z quiz R 8
  VISIBLE "updated quiz=" + scores'Z quiz
  VISIBLE "combined=" + SUM OF scores'Z quiz AN scores'Z project
KTHXBYE

BTW EXPECTED OUTPUT:
BTW quiz=7
BTW updated quiz=8
BTW combined=17
